            "smithy.api#documentation": "Input parameters of the execution represented as a JSON string. The size limit is 32KB. *Note*: If you are using the REST API directly to run your workflow, you must escape any JSON string value of `argument`. Example: `'{\"argument\":\"{\\\"firstName\\\":\\\"FIRST\\\",\\\"lastName\\\":\\\"LAST\\\"}\"}'`"
